msgstr "AUJOURD'HUI"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/motion/autostart.inc.php
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NOM"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "CAMERA MAIN STREAM"
msgstr "FLUX PRINCIPAL DE LA CAMÉRA"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid ""
"Device path like /dev/video0 or URL like http://... or rtsp://... are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Les périphériques comme /dev/video0 ou une URL comme http://... ou "
"rtsp://... sont supportés."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "e.g. /dev/video0 or http(s)://... or rtsp://..."
msgstr "ex : /dev/video0 ou http(s)://... ou rtsp://..."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "RESOLUTION"
msgstr "RÉSOLUTION"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "The selected resolution must match the resolution of the camera."
msgstr ""
"La résolution sélectionnée doit correspondre à la résolution de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "16/9 resolutions:"
msgstr "Résolutions 16/9 :"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "4/3 resolutions:"
msgstr "Résolutions 4/3 :"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "The specified frame rate must match the frame rate of the camera."
msgstr ""
"La fréquence d'images spécifiée doit correspondre à la fréquence d'images de "
"la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"Set to 0 to disable rotation. Warning: rotating the camera feed is a CPU "
"intensive operation."
msgstr ""
"Mettre à 0 pour désactiver la rotation. Attention : la rotation du flux de "
"la caméra est une opération intensive en CPU."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Text to display on the left side of the camera feed."
msgstr "Texte à afficher sur le côté gauche du flux de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Text to display on the right side of the camera feed."
msgstr "Texte à afficher sur le côté droit du flux de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "TIMESTAMP LEFT"
msgstr "HORODATAGE À GAUCHE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Display timestamp on the left side of the camera feed."
msgstr "Afficher l'horodatage sur le côté gauche du flux de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "TIMESTAMP RIGHT"
msgstr "HORODATAGE À DROITE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Display timestamp on the right side of the camera feed."
msgstr "Afficher l'horodatage sur le côté droit du flux de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "CAMERA SECONDARY STREAM"
msgstr "FLUX SECONDAIRE DE LA CAMÉRA"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"If the camera supports multiple streams and provides a secondary stream with "
"a lower resolution, you can add it here.<br>This secondary stream will be "
"used for the motion detection.<br>Device URL like http://... or rtsp://... "
"are supported."
msgstr ""
"Si la caméra supporte plusieurs flux et fournit un flux secondaire avec une "
"résolution plus faible, vous pouvez l'ajouter ici.<br>Ce flux secondaire "
"sera utilisé pour la détection de mouvement.<br>Les URL de périphérique "
"comme http://... ou rtsp://... sont supportées."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "e.g. http(s)://... or rtsp://..."
msgstr "ex : http(s)://... ou rtsp://..."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "SECONDARY STREAM RESOLUTION"
msgstr "RÉSOLUTION DU FLUX SECONDAIRE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"The selected resolution must match the resolution of the secondary stream of "
"the camera."
msgstr ""
"La résolution sélectionnée doit correspondre à la résolution du flux "
"secondaire de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "SECONDARY STREAM FRAME RATE"
msgstr "FRÉQUENCE D'IMAGES DU FLUX SECONDAIRE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"The specified frame rate must match the frame rate of the secondary stream "
"of the camera."
msgstr ""
"La fréquence d'images spécifiée doit correspondre à la fréquence d'images du "
"flux secondaire de la caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "AUTHENTICATION"
msgstr "AUTHENTIFICATION"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid ""
"If the camera requires authentication (to access the video stream or ONVIF "
"service)."
msgstr ""
"Si la caméra nécessite une authentification (pour accéder au flux vidéo ou "
"au service ONVIF)."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "USERNAME"
msgstr "NOM D'UTILISATEUR"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
#: views/includes/panels/camera/add.inc.php
msgid "PASSWORD"
msgstr "MOT DE PASSE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "ENABLE ONVIF"
msgstr "ACTIVER ONVIF"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"If camera supports ONVIF protocol. This will allow you to move the camera "
"using the PTZ controls."
msgstr ""
"Si la caméra supporte le protocole ONVIF. Cela vous permettra de déplacer la "
"caméra en utilisant les contrôles PTZ."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "ONVIF PORT"
msgstr "PORT ONVIF"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Port number of the ONVIF service. Default is 80."
msgstr "Numéro de port du service ONVIF. Par défaut : 80."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Target URL:"
msgstr "URL cible :"

