msgstr "Configurer la détection de mouvement pour cette caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Configurer"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "STREAM TECHNOLOGY"
msgstr "TECHNOLOGIE DE DIFFUSION"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid ""
"MSE should work without any additional configuration.<br>WebRTC is more "
"efficient and offer less latency but may not work in some cases.<br>MJPEG "
"should be used with http:// cameras."
msgstr ""
"MSE devrait fonctionner sans configuration supplémentaire.<br>WebRTC est "
"plus efficace et offre moins de latence mais peut ne pas fonctionner dans "
"certains cas.<br>MJPEG devrait être utilisé avec les caméras http://."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "ENABLE TIMELAPSE"
msgstr "ACTIVER LE TIMELAPSE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Enable timelapse for this camera."
msgstr "Activer le timelapse pour cette caméra."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "ENABLE MONITORING"
msgstr "ACTIVER LA SURVEILLANCE"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Email alert will be sent if the camera goes offline."
msgstr "Une alerte email sera envoyée si la caméra se déconnecte."

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "RECIPIENTS"
msgstr "DESTINATAIRES"

#: views/includes/camera/edit/form.inc.php
msgid "Email addresses to receive the alert notifications (comma separated)."
msgstr ""
"Adresses email pour recevoir les notifications d'alerte (séparées par des "
"virgules)."

